    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_mediating_perspectives_position",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-mediating-perspectives-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "The two positions sound incompatible because each side is arguing from its preferred solution rather than its underlying interest."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "دو موضع ناسازگار به نظر می‌رسن چون هر طرف از راه‌حل ترجیحی خودش حرف می‌زنه نه دغدغه زیرینش."
        },
        "intent": "separate_position_interest",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_position",
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_interest",
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_perspective"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "requests",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_mediating_perspectives_mediate",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-mediating-perspectives-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "To mediate fairly, I need to restate each perspective in terms the other side would recognize as accurate."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "برای میانجی‌گری منصفانه باید هر دیدگاه رو طوری بازگو کنم که طرف مقابل هم اون رو توصیف دقیقی بدونه."
        },
        "intent": "mediate_fairly",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_mediate",
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_perspective",
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_misrepresent"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "requests",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_mediating_perspectives_common",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-mediating-perspectives-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "There is common ground on reliability and cost; the disagreement is mainly about which risk deserves priority."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "روی قابلیت اتکا و هزینه زمینه مشترک هست؛ اختلاف اصلی درباره اینه که کدوم ریسک اولویت داره."
        },
        "intent": "identify_common_ground",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_common_ground",
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_interest"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "requests",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_mediating_perspectives_reframe",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-mediating-perspectives-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "I would reframe the conflict from 'central control versus local freedom' to 'where consistency matters and where flexibility adds value.'"
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اختلاف رو از «کنترل مرکزی در برابر آزادی محلی» به «کجا یکدستی مهمه و کجا انعطاف ارزش اضافه می‌کنه» بازقاب‌بندی می‌کنم."
        },
        "intent": "reframe_disagreement",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_reframe",
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_position"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "requests",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_mediating_perspectives_misrep",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-mediating-perspectives-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "A mediator loses trust quickly by simplifying one side's argument until it becomes easier to dismiss."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "میانجی وقتی استدلال یک طرف رو اون‌قدر ساده کنه که رد کردنش راحت بشه خیلی سریع اعتماد رو از دست می‌ده."
        },
        "intent": "avoid_misrepresentation",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_mediate",
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_misrepresent"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "requests",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_mediating_perspectives_bridge",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-mediating-perspectives-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "A temporary pilot may bridge the perspectives because it gives one side evidence and the other side a limit on commitment."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اجرای آزمایشی موقت شاید بین دیدگاه‌ها پل بزنه چون به یک طرف شواهد می‌ده و برای طرف دیگه تعهد رو محدود می‌کنه."
        },
        "intent": "bridge_perspectives",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_bridge",
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_perspective"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "requests",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_mediating_perspectives_interest2",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-mediating-perspectives-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "Once the underlying interests are visible, the negotiation has more options than the original yes-or-no positions suggested."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "وقتی دغدغه‌های زیرین روشن می‌شن، مذاکره گزینه‌های بیشتری از موضع‌های اولیه بله یا نه پیدا می‌کنه."
        },
        "intent": "expand_options",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_interest",
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_position"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "requests",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_mediating_perspectives_close",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-mediating-perspectives-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "Successful mediation does not require identical views; it requires enough shared understanding to make a workable decision."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "میانجی‌گری موفق نیاز به دیدگاه یکسان نداره؛ نیاز به درک مشترک کافی برای تصمیم عملی داره."
        },
        "intent": "summarize_mediation",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_mediate",
          "c1_mediating_perspectives_common_ground"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "requests",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_mediating_perspectives_reformulation",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-mediating-perspectives-01",
        "slug": "c1-mediating-perspectives-reformulation",
        "title": "Reformulation and precision",
        "rule_summary": "Use in other words, more precisely, what I mean is, or rather to refine a statement when the first wording is incomplete or misleading.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "با in other words، more precisely، what I mean is و or rather جمله را اصلاح یا دقیق‌تر می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "The system is inefficient—or rather, inefficient under peak demand.",
            "fa": "سیستم ناکارآمد است؛ یا دقیق‌تر بگویم، در اوج تقاضا ناکارآمد است."
          },
          {
            "en": "What I mean is that the risk is concentrated, not universal.",
            "fa": "منظورم این است که ریسک متمرکز است، نه همگانی."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_mediating_perspectives_diplomatic_language",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-mediating-perspectives-02",
        "slug": "c1-mediating-perspectives-diplomatic-language",
        "title": "Diplomatic challenge and disagreement",
        "rule_summary": "Challenge an idea rather than a person, acknowledge intent, and soften direct negatives while keeping the substantive point clear.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "به‌جای شخص، ایده را به چالش می‌کشیم؛ نیت را می‌پذیریم و بدون مبهم کردن اصل پیام، منفی مستقیم را نرم‌تر می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "I see the logic, though I'm not convinced the assumption holds in this case.",
            "fa": "منطقش را می‌بینم، هرچند قانع نشده‌ام این فرض در این مورد برقرار باشد."
          },
          {
            "en": "That may be true in principle, but the practical constraints are different.",
            "fa": "در اصل شاید درست باشد، اما محدودیت‌های عملی متفاوت‌اند."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_mediating_perspectives_concession_rebuttal",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-mediating-perspectives-03",
        "slug": "c1-mediating-perspectives-concession-rebuttal",
        "title": "Concession followed by rebuttal",
        "rule_summary": "Acknowledge a reasonable opposing point before limiting it or presenting a stronger counterargument.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "ابتدا یک نکته منطقی از طرف مقابل را می‌پذیریم و سپس دامنه آن را محدود می‌کنیم یا پاسخ قوی‌تری می‌دهیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "Granted, the process is faster; that does not necessarily make it fairer.",
            "fa": "درست است که روند سریع‌تر است؛ اما لزوماً عادلانه‌تر نیست."
          },
          {
            "en": "While that concern is valid, it overlooks the cost of doing nothing.",
            "fa": "با اینکه آن نگرانی معتبر است، هزینه هیچ کاری نکردن را نادیده می‌گیرد."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_c1_mediating_perspectives_scene_1",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-mediating-perspectives-01",
        "title": "Mediating Perspectives: part 1",
        "setting": "strategy meeting",
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "requests",
        "characters": [
          "Ella",
          "Amir"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Ella",
            "text": "What do you make of the way this is being framed?",
            "translation_fa": "از نحوه مطرح شدن این موضوع چه برداشتی داری؟"
